# Command ruflo

## What does this command do:

The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features enterprise-grade architecture, self-learning swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code / Codex Integration

## Installed from

For Fedora install using: npm install -g ruflo@latest

## Command path

For Fedora run: ~/.local/bin/ruflo

## Command documentation

Docs can be found at https://github.com/ruvnet/ruflo

## Command options

# PRIMARY COMMANDS
ruflo init                              # Initialize RuFlo in the current directory
ruflo start                             # Start the RuFlo orchestration system
ruflo status                            # Show system status
ruflo agent <subcommand>                # Agent management commands
ruflo swarm <subcommand>                # Swarm coordination commands
ruflo memory <subcommand>               # Memory management commands
